    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Erp Integration Service (erp-integration-service) — 4 operations.\n\nGENERATED from the OpenAPI 3.1.0 spec published at the UAT gateway swagger-ui\n(Select a definition -> \"Erp Integration Service APIs\"). Request bodies are schema-derived placeholders (lorem-ipsum\nstrings, sample numbers) — replace with real values before sending.\n\nBase URL: {{gatewayBaseUrl}}/erp-integration-service  (gatewayBaseUrl lives in EMI-dev.postman_environment.json).\nSpec server: https://gateway-emiuat.dg-cash.app/erp-integration-service\n\nAUTH: the spec declares no security scheme, but the gateway front-doors every route with a bearer\ntoken. Set {{token}} in the environment (mint one with the Authentication Service collection's\nsign-in, or pass --env-var token=... to newman). Some back-office routes need an admin/service\ntoken rather than a merchant one.\n\nCompanion Playwright scaffold: BusinessTestCases/ServiceApis/ErpIntegrationService.generated.spec.ts\n"
  },
